OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with patchy rain
OL,6,Fincreasingly reaching from the west,
OL,7,Fthough little is expected to penetrate
OL,8,Fas far as the east coast. South to
OL,9,Fsouthwest winds increasing fresh
OL,10,Faround the coasts during the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain for the evening, turning
OL,13,Fmore persistent late evening and
OL,14,Fduring the early hours of Friday
OL,15,Fmorning. Southwest winds easing light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
