OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRather cloudy morning with
OL,6,Fsome early patchy rain, mainly
OL,7,Fconfined across Borders. Clearing to
OL,8,Fbrighter spells and scattered showers
OL,9,Ffrom mid-day, with many in the east
OL,10,Fstaying dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FSaturday brings showers, with east
OL,14,Fmost sheltered. Sunday starts wet and
OL,15,Fwindy, before clearing to blustery
OL,16,Fshowers for afternoon. Monday mainly
OL,17,Fdry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
